<title>USA: INSIGHT - Dlr/mark sets sights on key 1.7405 level.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Dlr/mark sets sights on key 1.7405 level.</headline>
<text>
<p>DLR* *S/TERM RANGE  *SUPPORT *RESTNCE *RSI-14 *MA-8   *MA-13</p>
<p>DEM* *1.7260/1.7405 *1.7300  *1.7370  *66 pct *1.7178 *1.7008</p>
<p>YEN* *125.50/127.20 *125.90  *126.60  *61 pct *125.96 *124.85</p>
<p>-----------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET----------April 15-----------</p>
<p>*Dlr/mark nears 1.7405, reflects peak following Feb '94 dead cat bounce. Also caps at 8 pfennigs a rise from March low 1.6610, matching Aug-Oct '96 8-pfennig rally to 1.5450.</p>
<p>*Dollar/yen rangebound, last week's high 127.20 the objective.</p>
<p>*Mark/yen dips below 73, test of 72.50 support seen looming.</p>
<p>*Mark broadly weak, with sterling/mark seen pushing 2.8250, a 55-month high. Extended run to 3.00 seen as possibility.</p>
</text>
